        <characteristic name="Details" typeId="f78e-01c6-7e67-f2db">Friendly Psyker Models in your army may cast this power targeting a unit&apos;s weapons in a unit. If successful the target unit&apos;s Weapons with this Special Rule gain the following +1 S, +1 AP and +1 D modifications to their weapons until the end of the turn.</characteristic>
